{"steam_appid":3146520,"steam_name":"WEBFISHING","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3146520/760241/bd5bfa2d34dcb440a20e8753f03ec86439a4d156/1750824123/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1727142651","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257057787/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1727142651","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146520/ss_d1fdc753a7dc005896e239ea5ea055618a744bb6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1728673229","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146520/ss_93c1c90ce81dbf0fd3ca2aada73e1ff4c5e62a9a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1728673229","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146520/ss_8f5fe32a52b871c584f11416baf40634d17e72ee.1920x1080.jpg?t=1728673229","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146520/ss_15bdf6913c68f13e4769d950ac563e2d5706022b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1728673229","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146520/ss_70029d85f6aef4143b58a55b27824c278e14cbd9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1728673229"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146520/extras/50ebc95a1cdc7c3e2dcae3accdc61369.avif?t=1728673229\" width=550 height=178 /></span><strong>WEBFISHING</strong> is a multiplayer online casual fishing game where you relax, hang out, make friends, and catch fish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CATCH THEM ALL!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly <strong>100 </strong>different creatures to catch- from the smallest snail to the biggest shark- you can catch it! Complete your journal, find rare fish, get loads of money, and get tons of special rewards! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146520/extras/ceeb7ffe73a474edac32fb43ef05d33c.poster.avif?t=1728673229\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146520/extras/ceeb7ffe73a474edac32fb43ef05d33c.webm?t=1728673229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146520/extras/ceeb7ffe73a474edac32fb43ef05d33c.mp4?t=1728673229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE AND CUSTOMIZE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the ultimate fisherman! Upgrade your gear with new baits, lures, and rods- and collect tons of different cosmetics and props to show off your personality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146520/extras/50ca2a369a239df19b172a876346d119.poster.avif?t=1728673229\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146520/extras/50ca2a369a239df19b172a876346d119.webm?t=1728673229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY WITH FRIENDS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WEBFISHING is designed around being social and hanging out with friends and strangers in the camp! Meet new people, find hidden spots, make awful fish puns, and catch fish together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146520/extras/8ec78c8aa38d0349e99fbbc7c6a588f0.poster.avif?t=1728673229\" width=550 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146520/extras/8ec78c8aa38d0349e99fbbc7c6a588f0.webm?t=1728673229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146520/extras/8ec78c8aa38d0349e99fbbc7c6a588f0.mp4?t=1728673229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY WITH TOYS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play REAL Guitar! Punch your friends! Draw with chalk! There's many tools and toys to play with in the sandbox of WEBFISHING!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146520/extras/7f0bdd8cc44b087d0222e42a31536cec.poster.avif?t=1728673229\" width=550 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146520/extras/7f0bdd8cc44b087d0222e42a31536cec.webm?t=1728673229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3146520/extras/7f0bdd8cc44b087d0222e42a31536cec.mp4?t=1728673229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Massively Multiplayer"],"developers":["lamedeveloper"],"publishers":["lamedeveloper"],"release_date":"11 Oct, 2024"}